Homepage: https://github.com/iwikus/apachetop
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: apachetop-scoreboard
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: apache2
Description: Direct Apache HTTP Server scoreboard monitor
 apachetop reads the Apache httpd scoreboard directly from the APR
 shared-memory object instead of requesting /server-status over HTTP.
 .
 It displays worker state, client IP, vhost, request, age and aggregate
 request/byte counters. It can remain useful when an overloaded Apache
 instance has no workers available to serve a web request to /server-status.
